    },
    "The dB SPL produced at your ear when a full-scale (0 dBFS) digital sample plays through your current output device at your usual volume. Used to convert dBFS into dBA for dose tracking AND to anchor the Loudness lens's safety overlay to real SPL. Default 100 is a rough estimate for consumer headphones at moderate volume — for accurate values use the reference tone below." : {
